# large binary (~5 MB) regenerated by train_model.py or the inline fallback
# in utils/risk_model.py on first use.
#
# Azure cold-start note: if you want to skip the ~30s training on Azure cold
# starts, commit the .joblib file by commenting out the line below.
# Uncomment to exclude from git:
# models/*.joblib
 